* MPS6512 NPN model used by Q89-5 in VFO S/A 80289.
*
* No usable manufacturer SPICE model was located in the project library or
* current web search.  This is a nominal, datasheet-derived model intended for
* functional radio simulation, not device characterization.
*
* Fairchild 1971 data-sheet targets used:
*   VCEO >= 30 V; hFE = 50..100 at IC=2 mA, VCE=10 V
*   hFE >= 30 at IC=100 mA, VCE=10 V; Cob <= 3.5 pF
*   fT >= 250 MHz at IC=2 mA, VCE=10 V
*
* BF and IKF set nominal gain and high-current rolloff.  Junction capacitance
* and transit-time values are engineering approximations consistent with the
* published Cob and fT limits.

.model MPS6512 NPN(
+ Is=6.7f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=75 Bf=70 Ikf=100m Xtb=1.5
+ Br=1 Rc=1 Rb=10 Re=0.2
+ Cjc=3.1p Mjc=.31 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5
+ Cje=5p Mje=.26 Vje=.75
+ Tf=.5n Tr=200n
+)
